# Drop Kenney CC0 art here.
#
# Recommended packs (https://kenney.nl/assets):
#   - "Pixel Platformer"  or  "New Platformer Pack"
#
# Suggested layout:
#   public/assets/kenney/tiles.png
#   public/assets/kenney/characters.png
#
# Then load them in src/scenes/BootScene.ts (preload) instead of the generated
# placeholder rectangles, and swap the texture keys used by Player/GameScene.
# Files under public/ are copied verbatim into the build and are referenced
# relative to the Vite `base`, e.g. `assets/kenney/tiles.png`.
